    "description": "Group Project and presentation 35.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CAA201 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Project and presentation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14073 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CAA201 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Project and presentation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14073 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">35.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">60'</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO8, LO10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: This is a group-based project that involves the pitch and presentation of an advertising solution for a company. The group consists of 4-6 members. Group members have to work closely throughout the semester and give a formal presentation by the end of the course; Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Maximum length of the group assignment should be 20 pages excluding appendices. Presentation: 20-30 minutes and Q&amp;A 10 minutes ; Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: (Based on topics of studied unitsOption 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Group presentation in class<br><br>Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: This assignment should have 3 components: a formal presentation (Using slides), a report (Word) and a creative product (ad TVC, print ad or media kit) as part of the communication plan.<br><br>All assignments should be typed and double-spaced with 11-point font, and must be submitted in both soft and hard copy. A deduction of 10% of the assignment mark will be applied for each day of late submission<br><br>Evaluation will be based on both presentation, written report and creative product (reccommended 50%, 30% and 20% accordingly)<br><br>Option 2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 17 — Group Project and Presentation Guideline</li><li>Session 46 — Submission of group assignment report GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 47 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 48 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 49 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 50 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 51 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 52 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 17 — Group Project and Presentation Guideline</li><li>Buổi 46 — Submission of group assignment report GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 47 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 48 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 49 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 50 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 51 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 52 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=CAA201\">Exam Room — CAA201</a> (3 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=CAA201\">Phòng thi — CAA201</a> (3 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
